          "widget": {
            "name": "title",
            "textbox_spec": "# API Submit Monitor\nSummary KPIs are **last 24 hours**. Table is last N runs (`api_submit_last_n_runs`, default 1000) with recency rank. Use **Search job name** to filter the table."
